--- EXTRA RIGOR: real store compiled + EXECUTED (beyond P5) -----------
The Shared-free store/seam/policy/preview sources are byte-for-byte the repo files;
only stand-ins for the 6 Shared facade types (FacadeError, LiveConnectionState,
LiveEventKind, UnitPreferences, Units) are added. Compiled with
`swiftc -parse-as-library -swift-version 6` (Swift-6 strict concurrency) and RUN:
    PASS: open delivers content and goes live      (content + lastEventID + .fresh + isLive)
    PASS: stale keeps last value                   (phase=.stale, content retained, .stale)
    PASS: retryable error reconnects               (network drop -> reopen, openCount=2)
    PASS: 401 refresh + retry once                 (handleUnauthorized x1 -> reopen -> open)
    PASS: 401 no-recover surfaces error            (error=.auth, phase=.closed)
    PASS: 401 retries only once                    (2nd consecutive 401 -> no 2nd refresh)
    PASS: foreground resumes with Last-Event-ID    (background tears down; resume token "evt-1")
    PASS: deactivate stops processing              (post-deactivate events ignored)
    ALL_PASS  (LIVECHECK_EXIT=0)
This compile caught + fixed a real Swift-6 bug (NSLock.lock() unavailable from an
